{"seq":3,"slug":"threshold-moving","title":"阈值移动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/algorithm/threshold-moving","wordCount":1599,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"阈值移动\">阈值移动</h1><p>所有重采样、代价敏感、集成的努力，最后都要落到一个动作上：把模型输出的概率变成&quot;是&quot;或&quot;否&quot;。而绝大多数人从没质疑过那条默认的分界线——0.5。事实上，在不平衡问题里，0.5 几乎总是错的，而把它挪到合适的位置，是全 hub 里最便宜、见效最快的一招：不重新训练、不动数据、不改损失，只调一个数。这篇讲清阈值移动为什么有效、如何用数据把阈值选对，以及它与前两条路线的关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-0-5-不是天经地义\">核心概念：0.5 不是天经地义</h2><p>分类器（逻辑回归、梯度提升、神经网络）通常输出一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}=P(y{=}1\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再用一个阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 判定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}\\ge t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 判正、否则判负。默认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 只在一个隐含假设下最优——两类先验相等且误分类代价对称。不平衡恰恰同时破坏了这两个前提。</p>\n<p>回到<a href=\"../foundations/why-imbalance-hard\">为何不平衡难</a>的概率视角：极小的先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 把整条后验曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y{=}1\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压低，几乎没有样本能越过 0.5，于是模型近乎全判负——这就是<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a>里的&quot;多数类坍缩&quot;。但注意，模型对样本的<strong>排序能力</strong>可能完全正常，只是切点放错了地方。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 从 0.5 下调，让更多高分样本被判正，少数类召回立刻回升。关键前提是：模型概率的<strong>排序</strong>是好的（AUC 不差），此时阈值移动能救回来；若排序本身就烂（AUC 接近 0.5），挪阈值也没用，得回到重采样或代价敏感真正纠偏。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[模型输出概率 p_hat] --&gt; T{阈值 t 怎么定?}&#10;  T --&gt;|默认 0.5| Bad[少数类几乎全漏&lt;br/&gt;多数类坍缩]&#10;  T --&gt;|下调 t| Good[召回上升&lt;br/&gt;误报也上升]&#10;  Good --&gt; Pick{按什么选 t?}&#10;  Pick --&gt; M1[最大化 F-beta]&#10;  Pick --&gt; M2[最小化期望代价]&#10;  Pick --&gt; M3[固定召回下最优精确率]&#10;  M1 --&gt; CV[在验证集上搜索&lt;br/&gt;切勿用测试集]&#10;  M2 --&gt; CV&#10;  M3 --&gt; CV\">flowchart TD\n  P[模型输出概率 p_hat] --&gt; T{阈值 t 怎么定?}\n  T --&gt;|默认 0.5| Bad[少数类几乎全漏&lt;br/&gt;多数类坍缩]\n  T --&gt;|下调 t| Good[召回上升&lt;br/&gt;误报也上升]\n  Good --&gt; Pick{按什么选 t?}\n  Pick --&gt; M1[最大化 F-beta]\n  Pick --&gt; M2[最小化期望代价]\n  Pick --&gt; M3[固定召回下最优精确率]\n  M1 --&gt; CV[在验证集上搜索&lt;br/&gt;切勿用测试集]\n  M2 --&gt; CV\n  M3 --&gt; CV</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选阈值的准则</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>对应指标篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大化 F-beta</td>\n<td>平衡精确率/召回</td>\n<td>无明确金额代价</td>\n<td><a href=\"../practice/imbalance-metrics\">F-beta</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小化期望代价</td>\n<td>总代价最低</td>\n<td>有代价矩阵</td>\n<td><a href=\"cost-sensitive\">代价敏感</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定召回/精确率</td>\n<td>满足业务约束</td>\n<td>如&quot;召回≥90%&quot;</td>\n<td><a href=\"../practice/imbalance-metrics\">PR 曲线</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大化 G-mean/Youden</td>\n<td>两类召回均衡</td>\n<td>关注平衡</td>\n<td><a href=\"../practice/imbalance-metrics\">G-mean</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与代价敏感是一枚硬币\">与代价敏感是一枚硬币</h2><p>阈值移动和<a href=\"cost-sensitive\">代价敏感学习</a>常被当成两回事，其实是同一件事的两端。代价矩阵给定误报代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、漏报代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，最小化期望代价的贝叶斯最优阈值有闭式解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^* = \\frac{C_{FP}}{C_{FP} + C_{FN}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当漏报比误报贵 9 倍（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}=9,\\,C_{FP}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），最优阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*=0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>——把切点从 0.5 挪到 0.1。这说明：<strong>你既可以在训练时改损失让边界倾斜（代价敏感），也可以训练一个普通模型、在预测时挪阈值</strong>，二者在期望代价意义下等价。区别在成本：阈值移动完全不用重新训练，改一个数即可，因此<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-spectrum\">处理谱系</a>的&quot;由廉到贵&quot;里它排在重采样和集成之前。一个重要前提是模型输出的概率要<strong>校准良好</strong>——若概率没校准，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的闭式解会失真，此时应改用在验证集上直接搜索经验最优阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"如何把阈值选对-用验证集搜索\">如何把阈值选对：用验证集搜索</h2><p>实践中很少直接套闭式解，更稳的做法是在验证集上扫描阈值、按选定准则挑最优。scikit-learn（当前 1.9.x）为此提供了 <code>TunedThresholdClassifierCV</code>，它用交叉验证在内部自动搜索使给定评分最优的阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.model_selection import TunedThresholdClassifierCV&#10;from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression&#10;&#10;base = LogisticRegression(class_weight=&quot;balanced&quot;)&#10;# 自动交叉验证搜索使 F-beta(β=2) 最优的阈值&#10;tuned = TunedThresholdClassifierCV(&#10;    base, scoring=&quot;f1_weighted&quot;, cv=5,&#10;)&#10;tuned.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;print(tuned.best_threshold_)  # 学到的最优判定阈值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TunedThresholdClassifierCV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.linear_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">class_weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"balanced\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自动交叉验证搜索使 F-beta(β=2) 最优的阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tuned </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TunedThresholdClassifierCV(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    base, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scoring</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"f1_weighted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tuned.fit(X_train, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tuned.best_threshold_)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 学到的最优判定阈值</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有三条纪律不能破。其一，<strong>阈值必须在与训练集独立的验证集（或交叉验证的验证折）上选</strong>，绝不能在测试集上调——否则就是把测试集信息泄漏进决策，离线指标虚高，这与<a href=\"../practice/resampling-pitfalls\">重采样陷阱</a>讲的泄漏同源。其二，选阈值的准则要与业务目标一致：想要高召回就用 F-beta（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）或直接约束&quot;召回≥某值下最大化精确率&quot;，具体指标含义见<a href=\"../practice/imbalance-metrics\">评估指标</a>。其三，阈值会随类别分布漂移而失效——线上正类比例变了，昨天最优的阈值今天可能就偏了，需要定期重校，这属于<a href=\"../practice/imbalance-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>与监控的范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值移动的边界-它不是万能的\">阈值移动的边界：它不是万能的</h2><p>必须诚实地划清它的能力边界。阈值移动只挪动一维的切点，它<strong>不改变模型的排序能力</strong>——ROC 曲线、PR 曲线上的每个点都是不同阈值对应的工作点，阈值移动只是在这条既定曲线上选一个位置，无法把曲线整体抬高。因此：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若模型 AUC 就很低（排序烂），说明判别信息不足，挪阈值没用，得回去做<a href=\"../resampling/smote-variants\">重采样</a>、<a href=\"cost-sensitive\">代价敏感</a>或改特征。</li>\n<li>若下游要的是<strong>校准的概率</strong>（比如做期望收益计算、风险定价），单纯挪阈值把概率二值化会丢掉概率信息，此时更该关注概率校准而非阈值。</li>\n<li>阈值移动解决的是&quot;切点错位&quot;，而<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a>里的类别重叠、绝对稀少这些&quot;信息不足&quot;型失效，它一概无能为力。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正因为便宜，它值得<strong>永远第一个试</strong>：训练一个普通（或已加权）的模型，先在验证集上把阈值调好，看看召回能不能达标——很多时候这一步就够了，根本轮不到 SMOTE 和集成上场。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-spectrum\">处理谱系</a>反复强调的&quot;别过度工程&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>默认阈值 0.5 只在先验相等且代价对称时最优，不平衡同时破坏这两个前提，导致多数类坍缩。</li>\n<li>只要模型排序（AUC）尚可，下调阈值就能救回少数类召回——这是全 hub 最便宜、不用重训的一招。</li>\n<li>阈值移动与<a href=\"cost-sensitive\">代价敏感</a>是一枚硬币：代价给定时最优阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*=C_{FP}/(C_{FP}+C_{FN})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但需概率校准良好。</li>\n<li>实践用 <code>TunedThresholdClassifierCV</code> 在验证集上按 F-beta/期望代价搜索阈值，三条纪律：别用测试集、准则对齐业务、随漂移重校。</li>\n<li>边界：它只在既定 ROC/PR 曲线上选点，救不了排序烂、信息不足、需校准概率的情形——那些得回到<a href=\"../resampling/smote-variants\">重采样</a>与<a href=\"../practice/imbalance-metrics\">评估指标</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"cost-sensitive\">代价敏感学习</a> · <a href=\"ensemble-imbalance\">集成方法</a> · <a href=\"../practice/imbalance-metrics\">评估指标</a> · <a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-spectrum\">处理谱系</a> · <a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../anomaly-detection/practice/thresholding-deployment\">异常检测 · 阈值与部署</a> —— 异常检测同样面对&quot;给分数定切点&quot;的问题，其阈值选择思路与本文互为镜像。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>数据来源：scikit-learn 1.9.x 的 <code>TunedThresholdClassifierCV</code> 支持交叉验证搜索最优判定阈值、并可路由 <code>sample_weight</code>，见 <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.model_selection.TunedThresholdClassifierCV.html\">TunedThresholdClassifierCV 文档</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"阈值移动","id":"阈值移动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：0.5 不是天经地义","id":"核心概念-0-5-不是天经地义"},{"level":2,"text":"与代价敏感是一枚硬币","id":"与代价敏感是一枚硬币"},{"level":2,"text":"如何把阈值选对：用验证集搜索","id":"如何把阈值选对-用验证集搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值移动的边界：它不是万能的","id":"阈值移动的边界-它不是万能的"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"集成方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/algorithm/ensemble-imbalance"},"next":{"title":"评估指标 (PR-AUC/F)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/practice/imbalance-metrics"}}